                "lastName": "Kafno"
            }
        ],
        "abstract": "Rapid developments in digital technology provoke a major challenge for content providers. As the key 16–34 demographic spends increasing time on internet services, established linear genres, programming strategies and durations come into question. This paper looks at the content challenge and the interactive authoring tools that are being developed to meet it.",
        "keywords": {}
    }
